<!--
   Auto backup rules for Android 11 and lower.
   A full backup is intentional: with no rules, all app data, including the
   vehicle-maintenance.json store, is copied to the user's own Google account
   backup so their history follows them to a new phone. The privacy policy and
   the Data safety answers in play-store/ describe this; keep them in step if
   this changes. Cache is never backed up, so shared PDFs are not included.
-->
<full-backup-content />
